OL,5,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FMore than 60 thefts are reported
OL,7,     Fto Derbyshire Police every day. In
OL,8,     Fthis episode, following a rise in
OL,9,     Fthefts across the East Midlands,
OL,10,     Fofficers target organised gangs of
OL,11,     Fthieves.
OL,12,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FThis episode opens with the hunt
OL,14,     Ffor three teens alleged to have
OL,15,     Fthreatened a shopkeeper with a
OL,16,     Fgun. The firearms team flood the
OL,17,     Farea.
