OL,5,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FOn a stormy night, the
OL,7,     FInterceptors get on the tail of a
OL,8,     Ffast-moving Astra that's been
OL,9,     Freported stolen. The desperate
OL,10,     Fdriver twice evades the jaws of
OL,11,     FPaul and Lewis's stinger.
OL,12,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FPolice pursue a van alleged to
OL,14,     Fhave be involved in burglaries.
OL,15,     FBut as they pursue the van into a
OL,16,     Ftravellers' camp, all hell breaks
OL,17,     Floose. And a runaway vehicle
OL,18,     Frepeatedly rams cops.
