OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FA student waiting to see if his
OL,7,     FA-level results will allow him to
OL,8,     Fstudy medicine at university is
OL,9,     Fsent to hosptial for tests on a
OL,10,     Fstomach complaint.
OL,11,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,12,     FChristine, 71, has a bleeding head
OL,13,     Ffollowing a fall. As she is on
OL,14,     Fblood thinners, a scan is urgently
OL,15,     Fneeded. Dean has necrotising
OL,16,     Ffasciitis, a flesh-eating
OL,17,     Finfection.
