OL,5,G2100 Fare Dodgers: At War with the Law
OL,6,     FTransport for London investigators
OL,7,     Fhunt for a suspected prolific fare
OL,8,     Fevader owing the network almost
OL,9,     F#4k. In Nottingham, revenue
OL,10,     Fprotection agents conduct a plain
OL,11,     Fclothes operation.
OL,12,G2200 Call the Bailiffs: Time to...
OL,13,     F...Pay Up! Lewis pursues a former
OL,14,     Ftenant who owes more than #20k in
OL,15,     Frent arrears. Alex heads to the HQ
OL,16,     Fof an airline to enforce a
OL,17,     Fjudgment awarded to a customer
OL,18,     Fafter a delayed flight.
